### Route a user-service request through TaxiAgent Gateway
GET http://localhost:9000/api/users/ping
Accept: application/json
X-Trace-Id: local-gateway-check

### Route an auth-service request through TaxiAgent Gateway
GET http://localhost:9000/api/auth/ping
Accept: application/json
X-Trace-Id: local-auth-gateway-check

### Protected routes require a JWT issued by Auth Service
@accessToken = replace-with-access-token
GET http://localhost:9000/api/users/private-example
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
